    "measurementTechnique": [
      "Subsurface biogeochemistry was monitored from April 7th to April 23rd 2018 using a small subset of the aquifer sampling tubes installed in the \u201cdense array\u201d, a unique hyporheic and parafluvial zone water sampling system that draws from a large array of riverbed monitoring points. Sample water was drawn from 3 different locations in the shoreside subsurface and passed through a manifold containing a number of sensor systems, including a novel dissolved oxygen sensor provided by OptiO2, LLC, (Okemos, MI, USA). Further methods are detailed in [insert reference upon acceptance]"
    ],
